{"title": "Soul Coin", "pageid": 42, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Soul_Coin", "categories": ["Bugs", "Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Soul_Coin_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Soul_Coin_Faded.png/300px-Soul_Coin_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/b/b4/Soul_Coin_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Soul Coin image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Soul_Coin_Faded.png/300px-Soul_Coin_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b4/Soul_Coin_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\"><b>Soul Coins</b></span> are small, coin-shaped objects forged of <a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_iron\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Infernal iron\">infernal iron</a> into which a single mortal soul is bound. They are used as currency in the <a href=\"/wiki/Nine_Hells\" title=\"Nine Hells\">Nine Hells</a> and can power infernal engines such as the one in <a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\">Karlach's</a> chest.\n</p><p>Karlach can consume soul coins to obtain <a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Fury_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Fury (Condition)\">Infernal Fury</a> until the next <a href=\"/wiki/Resting\" title=\"Resting\">long rest</a>.\n</p><p>A total of 19 Soul Coins are scattered across all three Acts of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a></i>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Strange, incomprehensible whispers emanate from this coin, pervading your mind with rage and despair.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/38px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Single Use\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Single Use</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.01 kg (0.02 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.01 kg (0.02 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 100 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  100  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-2bdbc9600f6c5bf2END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-2c1344452d10b09fEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-1098b7cccb1ed514END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOOT_SoulCoin</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOOT_SoulCoin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOOT_SoulCoin\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">8c68e68d-96d4-45d6-804c-5f31ac948ff3</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:8c68e68d-96d4-45d6-804c-5f31ac948ff3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:8c68e68d-96d4-45d6-804c-5f31ac948ff3\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">GLO_SoulCoin</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GLO_SoulCoin+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GLO_SoulCoin+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Infernal_Fury\"> Condition: Infernal Fury </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Fury_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Fury (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Infernal Fury\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Fury_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Fury (Condition)\">Infernal Fury</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The hatred and pain of a captured soul fuels <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/38px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/50px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karlach's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\">Karlach's</a> infernal machine.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Her weapon and unarmed attacks deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage when she is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rage_(Condition)\" title=\"Rage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Raging\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rage_(Condition)\" title=\"Rage (Condition)\">Raging</a> or when her <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a> drop below 25%.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_One\">Act One</span></h3>\n<ul><li>1x - in a sarcophagus in the trapped room of the <a href=\"/wiki/Dank_Crypt\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dank Crypt\">Dank Crypt</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-304&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-323</span></li>\n<li>1x - in a sarcophagus next to the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Dead_Gods\" title=\"Book of Dead Gods\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Book_Tome_E_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Tome_E_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Book_Tome_E_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_E_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Book_Tome_E_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Tome_E_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Book_Tome_E_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Tome_E_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Book_Tome_E_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Dead_Gods\" title=\"Book of Dead Gods\">Book of Dead Gods</a> within the Dank Crypt at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-324&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-274</span></li>\n<li>1x - in the sarcophagus that <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/25px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/38px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/50px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Withers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/25px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\">Withers</a> emerges from in the Dank Crypt at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-290&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-235</span></li>\n<li>1x - carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nadira\" title=\"Nadira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/Portrait_Nadira.png/25px-Portrait_Nadira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/96/Portrait_Nadira.png/38px-Portrait_Nadira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/96/Portrait_Nadira.png/50px-Portrait_Nadira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nadira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/Portrait_Nadira.png/25px-Portrait_Nadira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/96/Portrait_Nadira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nadira\" title=\"Nadira\">Nadira</a> at the top of a hill in the <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">Emerald Grove</a></li>\n<li>1x - on the balcony of the Toll House at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Risen_Road\" title=\"The Risen Road\">The Risen Road</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;109&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;550</span></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Two\">Act Two</span></h3>\n<ul><li>1x - on a table behind a secret wall in <a href=\"/wiki/Reithwin_Tollhouse\" title=\"Reithwin Tollhouse\">Reithwin Tollhouse</a> basement at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;301&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-715</span></li>\n<li>3x - sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lann_Tarv\" title=\"Lann Tarv\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png/25px-Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png/38px-Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png/50px-Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lann Tarv\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png/25px-Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lann_Tarv\" title=\"Lann Tarv\">Lann Tarv</a>, the bugbear merchant in the main hall of <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Three\">Act Three</span></h3>\n<ul><li>1x - the mailbox outside Peartree's house, <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;32&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-96</span></li>\n<li>2x - in the basement of <a href=\"/wiki/Peartree_House\" title=\"Peartree House\">Peartree House</a>, inside a \"Strongbox\" on the wall</li>\n<li>5x - inside <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/25px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/38px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/50px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Raphael's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/25px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael's</a> safe at the Boudoir in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a></li>\n<li>1x - in <a href=\"/wiki/Philgrave%27s_Mansion\" title=\"Philgrave's Mansion\">Philgrave's Mansion</a> inside Viscera</li>\n<li>1x - in the Rustic Chest atop the stairs in Nortale's Hostel, <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;90&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-56</span></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The coin from Nadira can be looted or pickpocketed, or Nadira can offer it after saving her from a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bugbear_Assassin\" title=\"Bugbear Assassin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/Portrait_Bugbear_Assassin.png/25px-Portrait_Bugbear_Assassin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a6/Portrait_Bugbear_Assassin.png/38px-Portrait_Bugbear_Assassin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a6/Portrait_Bugbear_Assassin.png/50px-Portrait_Bugbear_Assassin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bugbear Assassin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/Portrait_Bugbear_Assassin.png/25px-Portrait_Bugbear_Assassin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a6/Portrait_Bugbear_Assassin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bugbear_Assassin\" title=\"Bugbear Assassin\">Bugbear Assassin</a> and passing a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Persuasion Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Intimidation Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Intimidation\" title=\"Intimidation\">Intimidation</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>.</li>\n<li>If <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/38px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/50px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karlach\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\">Karlach</a> is present when a party member talks to Lann Tarv, the coins can be obtained without spending money if they listen to the stories behind each of the three souls.</li>\n<li>Collecting a Soul Coin for the first time grants the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Noble#Soul_for_Sale\" title=\"Noble\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soul for Sale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Noble#Soul_for_Sale\" title=\"Noble\">Soul for Sale</a> to party members with the <a href=\"/wiki/Noble\" title=\"Noble\">Noble</a> background.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Karlach deals <i>two</i> extra instances of <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage (for a total of 2d4) when making an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unarmed_Strike\" title=\"Unarmed Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/25px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/38px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/50px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unarmed Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/25px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmed_Strike\" title=\"Unarmed Strike\">Unarmed Strike</a> with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Fury_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Fury (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Infernal Fury\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Fury_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Fury (Condition)\">Infernal Fury</a> buff active. She deals this extra damage regardless of her class, raging status, and current hit points.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>When a party member picks up the Soul Coin on the balcony at the <a href=\"/wiki/Risen_Road\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Risen Road\">Risen Road</a>, it is somehow possible to pick it up from the ground floor. This causes the interacting party member to go out of bounds. This issue can be resolved by teleporting to the campsite and back.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Soul_coin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soul coin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Soul_coin\">Soul coin</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195521\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.119 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.124 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5639/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 70118/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 22271/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive pa